WEBVTT

00:47.450 --> 00:53.200
A ray of light, a glimpse of hope

00:54.090 --> 00:59.640
Rising through thorns, a
glimmer through the cracks

01:00.830 --> 01:06.590
Look up and behold, transcending time

01:07.460 --> 01:13.070
Through ages and cataclysms,
I'll stand watch for you

01:13.780 --> 01:19.440
Even millennia later, I won't forget you

01:20.310 --> 01:25.820
In a world without
you, I'll defy fate itself

01:25.830 --> 01:31.080
Cracks, piercing through the heart

01:31.550 --> 01:38.100
Armoured, at the end of a vast battlefield

01:38.450 --> 01:44.460
Light slipping through my fingers

01:45.040 --> 01:51.550
My fate, under my command
who cares if it's divine or demonic?

01:51.570 --> 01:57.970
Cracks, piercing through the heart

01:58.330 --> 02:02.449
Eternity unbroken,
love and hate left behind

02:02.450 --> 02:07.570
All passed by

02:09.180 --> 02:14.460
Cracks, piercing through the heart

02:15.080 --> 02:21.900
Armoured, at the end of a vast battlefield

02:21.910 --> 02:28.260
Light slipping through my fingers

02:28.270 --> 02:35.050
When the end arrives,
no one will destroy me

02:35.200 --> 02:38.410
Forever unyielding

02:41.800 --> 02:47.510
Forever undying

02:47.970 --> 02:50.170
World of Immortals

02:50.171 --> 02:51.230
 Dragon Island Arc

02:51.740 --> 02:54.220
Episode 3

02:54.221 --> 02:56.700
Dancing with Beasts

02:57.180 --> 03:05.180
Previously

02:58.090 --> 02:59.090
Yue!

02:59.210 --> 03:00.810
You insolent brat,

03:01.210 --> 03:03.010
you will pay for my junior's life.

03:08.210 --> 03:09.210
I never expected that

03:09.490 --> 03:10.610
today, with this dragon egg,

03:10.770 --> 03:12.530
I would finally
breakthrough my limitations.

03:12.730 --> 03:14.330
Awakening the Heavenly Stele Method.

03:14.650 --> 03:15.450
Is this

03:15.570 --> 03:16.770
the Ancient Tyrannosaurus Rex?

03:21.650 --> 03:23.489
I have made ample preparations this time.

03:23.490 --> 03:26.010
I will definitely manage to bring
back some Dragon King eggs.

03:34.740 --> 03:38.340
Forbidden Sea

03:50.970 --> 03:51.970
What happened?

03:52.210 --> 03:53.370
We've hit a reef.

04:04.530 --> 04:06.050
What is that?

04:09.210 --> 04:12.770
There's a monster!

04:22.610 --> 04:24.010
Young master, save me!

04:24.130 --> 04:25.210
Take my hand.

04:38.050 --> 04:40.450
<i>Young master</i>

04:45.650 --> 04:47.129
<i>The ship is utterly destroyed,</i>

04:47.130 --> 04:49.090
<i>and those onboard have
likely met a tragic fate.</i>

04:49.100 --> 04:52.089
Distant Sea River Valley

04:52.090 --> 04:53.890
<i>With the evil dragon prowling nearshore,</i>

04:54.130 --> 04:55.810
<i>attempting to leave by boat is hopeless.</i>

04:56.090 --> 04:57.130
<i>Another way must be found.</i>

05:01.010 --> 05:02.010
What's that sound?

05:07.220 --> 05:12.180
Four-Armed Giant Ape

05:12.250 --> 05:14.010
A giant ape with four arms?

05:19.570 --> 05:20.770
Wait,

05:24.010 --> 05:25.890
it's following the scent
of meat to find me.

05:41.010 --> 05:42.090
Now's my chance...

05:45.910 --> 05:46.910
No!

05:50.890 --> 05:52.890
What do you want?

05:54.230 --> 05:54.870
Let go of me!

05:55.090 --> 05:56.410
Where are you taking me?

06:11.050 --> 06:12.810
What is this place?

06:13.970 --> 06:15.610
What's it planning?

06:16.690 --> 06:19.329
Is it going to keep me here as food?

06:19.330 --> 06:21.490
No, I have to escape quickly.

06:29.650 --> 06:32.570
You want me to cook for you?

06:46.650 --> 06:49.690
Rushing won't get us anywhere.

06:49.970 --> 06:51.209
If you keep interfering like this,

06:51.210 --> 06:53.050
this meat will burn again.

06:58.970 --> 07:00.769
This place is elevated

07:00.770 --> 07:02.049
with a good water source.

07:02.050 --> 07:04.130
It seems like a safe, habitable spot.

07:05.810 --> 07:07.530
With an abundance of spiritual energy here,

07:07.690 --> 07:09.730
I can heal and cultivate

07:09.850 --> 07:11.970
while searching for a way back to Jiuzhou.

07:21.890 --> 07:23.370
What's the matter?

07:38.610 --> 07:40.650
Are you teaching me how
to absorb spiritual energy?

07:42.650 --> 07:43.650
I'll give it a try.

07:53.170 --> 07:55.089
You're large,

07:55.090 --> 07:56.450
so you need to absorb more energy.

07:57.170 --> 07:58.290
For me, this much is enough.

07:58.690 --> 08:00.009
<i>Cultivating in the Mortal Shedding Realm</i>

08:00.010 --> 08:02.410
<i>requires an immense amount of
essence from the sun and moon.</i>

08:02.730 --> 08:04.529
<i>After absorbing so much spiritual energy,</i>

08:04.530 --> 08:07.050
<i>I can only barely sense a
breakthrough in the first level.</i>

08:08.370 --> 08:10.850
<i>It seems it will take some
time to truly progress.</i>

08:12.610 --> 08:14.970
Zhao Lin'er and I have both
ended up on Dragon Island.

08:15.290 --> 08:17.410
Lan Nuo is likely here too,

08:18.050 --> 08:19.129
though it's unclear

08:19.130 --> 08:21.610
where she might be.

08:22.450 --> 08:24.089
Even nearshore,

08:24.090 --> 08:25.690
the island is crawling with wild beasts,

08:26.130 --> 08:28.170
hinting at greater dangers within.

08:30.170 --> 08:31.489
I must recover swiftly,

08:31.490 --> 08:32.530
strengthen myself,

08:32.650 --> 08:34.490
and head inland to find her

08:35.810 --> 08:37.570
and confront that dangerous woman.

09:38.610 --> 09:40.609
These past few days, I've been
having roasted meat with the ape daily,

09:40.610 --> 09:42.306
and it's getting a bit
too rich for my taste.

09:42.330 --> 09:43.929
Today, I plan to pick
some fruits to try instead,

09:43.930 --> 09:45.730
and I'll bring some
back for the ape as well.

09:46.690 --> 09:49.730
Will the fruits in the World of
Immortals help with cultivation?

09:51.610 --> 09:52.610
Little unicorn,

09:53.970 --> 09:56.186
thank you for distracting the
tyrannosaurus for me last time.

09:56.210 --> 09:58.010
Here, have some of this.

10:00.290 --> 10:01.850
Where are you going?

10:02.490 --> 10:03.490
Come back!

10:07.730 --> 10:09.330
Where did that little fellow run off to?

10:18.970 --> 10:21.610
So you're still alive after all.

10:27.010 --> 10:28.970
To escape from the jaws of the evil dragon,

10:29.170 --> 10:30.490
you must have quite the luck.

10:30.930 --> 10:31.930
But today,

10:32.130 --> 10:33.850
I will personally put an end to you.

10:35.410 --> 10:38.490
You've already said that kind of
thing when you were in Jiuzhou.

10:54.290 --> 10:55.290
He's so fast.

11:03.890 --> 11:06.650
How did his speed and
strength improve so much?

11:07.250 --> 11:09.210
Has he encountered some
kind of fortuitous event?

11:10.810 --> 11:13.330
It seems I really
underestimated you before.

11:16.650 --> 11:17.890
We are of the same kin.

11:18.450 --> 11:20.610
Do you truly wish for this
to be a fight to the death?

11:28.810 --> 11:30.170
Accept your fate!

11:39.210 --> 11:40.810
You've made several attempts on my life.

11:41.250 --> 11:43.090
Do you really think I'm so easy to bully?

11:43.620 --> 11:46.780
Dragon Vitality Form

11:51.770 --> 11:54.930
<i>That last move has
drained most of my vitality.</i>

11:55.290 --> 11:57.490
<i>I probably can't use it again for a while.</i>

12:00.250 --> 12:01.530
<i>In just a few days,</i>

12:01.790 --> 12:03.790
<i>he has grown to this extent.</i>

12:05.530 --> 12:07.049
<i>I must eliminate him</i>

12:07.050 --> 12:08.370
<i>to prevent future troubles.</i>

12:07.180 --> 12:09.449
Rainbow Sword Technique

12:08.371 --> 12:10.100
Scarlet Flame

12:09.450 --> 12:10.986
You have brought disgrace
upon the imperial authority

12:11.010 --> 12:12.570
and caused my downfall.

12:13.690 --> 12:15.450
You must die.

12:37.620 --> 12:38.860
Feathered Rainbow Slash

12:38.650 --> 12:39.650
It is over.

12:38.861 --> 12:40.100
Rainbow Sword Technique

12:41.170 --> 12:42.170
What?

12:54.690 --> 12:55.850
Four-Armed Giant Ape?

12:56.890 --> 12:57.490
Ape.

12:57.850 --> 12:59.650
No one can save you today.

13:12.770 --> 13:13.970
Startling Swan!

13:12.780 --> 13:15.860
Rainbow Sword Technique

13:13.971 --> 13:15.860
Startling Swan

13:22.050 --> 13:23.050
Ape!

13:42.770 --> 13:45.690
It seems I must deal with
this beast before I can kill him.

14:19.010 --> 14:21.330
Has that little unicorn saved her?

14:22.330 --> 14:23.930
If I stay here any longer,

14:24.130 --> 14:26.250
I might cause you trouble.

14:34.850 --> 14:36.890
Please don't be angry.

14:37.570 --> 14:40.370
There is enough meat and fruit
for you to feast on for a while.

14:41.170 --> 14:43.730
I should be on my way to
find the path back home.

14:53.850 --> 14:55.050
This is your home,

14:55.450 --> 14:56.450
not mine.

14:57.610 --> 14:59.530
My home is far away,

15:00.610 --> 15:02.530
and there are still people
waiting for me there.

15:10.210 --> 15:11.330
Ape.

15:43.570 --> 15:44.410
I understand now.

15:44.570 --> 15:46.130
I will devote myself to my training.

15:48.210 --> 15:49.210
<i>Farewell,</i>

15:50.130 --> 15:51.130
<i>Ape.</i>

15:56.020 --> 16:00.980
By the Mirror Lake Stream

16:04.130 --> 16:05.610
Are your injuries any better?

16:07.090 --> 16:08.530
Thank you for saving me.

16:09.970 --> 16:11.050
This place is beautiful,

16:13.170 --> 16:14.450
but there is nothing here.

16:16.050 --> 16:17.770
There is no entourage,

16:18.850 --> 16:20.490
no crowd watching.

16:21.490 --> 16:24.810
I am no longer the naturally
esteemed Royal Celestial Maiden.

16:31.810 --> 16:32.890
Little one,

16:34.170 --> 16:36.330
there are dangers everywhere in this place.

16:36.770 --> 16:38.770
How did you manage to survive?

16:40.970 --> 16:44.050
How am I supposed to live?

17:01.530 --> 17:04.730
Are you going to acknowledge
meas your master?

17:42.610 --> 17:43.610
What is this?

17:43.890 --> 17:44.730
How

17:44.731 --> 17:46.050
amazing.

17:52.370 --> 17:54.970
<i>Since you acknowledge me as your master,</i>

17:55.690 --> 17:57.690
<i>I must pull myself together.</i>

17:58.450 --> 18:02.090
<i>The past in Jiuzhou is
behind me; I will not dwell on it.</i>

18:02.610 --> 18:05.010
<i>Even if I find myself
in a difficult situation,</i>

18:05.370 --> 18:08.249
<i>I will still forge ahead in
this World of Immortals,</i>

18:08.250 --> 18:10.090
<i>treating danger like nothing.</i>

18:12.580 --> 18:17.540
Coast of the Forbidden Sea

18:38.700 --> 18:46.700
Recreate Immortality with "Perfect
World" and "World of Immortals"

18:39.410 --> 18:40.410
If one day

18:41.050 --> 18:42.090
the stars burst

18:42.730 --> 18:44.170
and the cosmos is thrown into chaos,

18:44.610 --> 18:46.650
many old acquaintances
will grow old and fade away,

18:46.770 --> 18:48.130
their souls returning to the earth

18:48.330 --> 18:50.050
and lost to time.

18:51.690 --> 18:53.450
Although you may be
unmatched in this world,

18:54.090 --> 18:56.770
you will find yourself standing
alone in the river of time,

18:57.570 --> 18:58.810
reflecting on the ages

18:59.890 --> 19:01.250
and safeguarding your immortality.

19:10.210 --> 19:11.490
The immortal sages persist,

19:12.330 --> 19:14.090
while great thieves
continue their exploits.

19:15.010 --> 19:16.690
Many remarkable talents throughout history

19:17.330 --> 19:18.690
have faded into obscurity simply

19:19.810 --> 19:22.090
because they never attained immortal life.

19:25.210 --> 19:27.210
Now, as the heavens and earth stand still,

19:27.690 --> 19:29.130
only by shattering illusions

19:29.450 --> 19:30.450
and ending chaos

19:31.330 --> 19:34.370
can true immortality be reborn.

19:35.310 --> 19:38.300
World of Immortals

19:36.230 --> 19:38.150
 Dragon Island Arc

20:28.960 --> 20:35.960
A heart untouched by
dust, letting the past remain

20:36.560 --> 20:42.160
Old wounds hidden away by the years

20:43.160 --> 20:47.160
Turning through forgetfulness

20:47.480 --> 20:50.520
Fate is long-lasting

20:50.720 --> 20:56.080
Yet I still faintly remember your image

20:57.200 --> 21:00.079
Your gentle smile like the breeze

21:00.080 --> 21:04.000
A light shadow flowing
like water, with no echo

21:04.400 --> 21:07.119
Grant me a lifetime of wind and snow

21:07.120 --> 21:11.040
Together, we'll admire the
moonlight until the end of time

21:11.480 --> 21:15.640
A glance back feels like the first meeting

21:15.800 --> 21:18.760
The touch still warm to the skin

21:19.360 --> 21:21.159
The departed return to seek

21:21.160 --> 21:24.960
No regrets for the love once shared

21:25.400 --> 21:28.199
If only tender feelings could last forever

21:28.200 --> 21:32.240
Nourishing beauty as I look back once more

21:32.520 --> 21:35.319
I wish for the sea to remain untroubled

21:35.320 --> 21:39.280
The heart stays the same,
do not ponder too much

21:39.600 --> 21:43.999
That year by the jade zither,
listening to the flowers fall

21:44.000 --> 21:47.280
Ripples at the centre of tears

21:47.560 --> 21:49.479
This love can wait

21:49.480 --> 21:53.400
To see that yellowing scene again

21:54.600 --> 21:56.519
Through the long years

21:56.520 --> 22:01.200
Together with you in vastness

22:01.680 --> 22:04.679
Asking the world

22:04.680 --> 22:08.520
How can love be complete?

22:08.840 --> 22:11.959
Remembering the past years

22:11.960 --> 22:15.400
Always feeling indebted

22:15.840 --> 22:18.520
When will we

22:18.840 --> 22:22.680
Meet again?

22:22.880 --> 22:25.600
Once stood side by side

22:26.040 --> 22:29.880
Talking for ages

22:59.790 --> 23:07.790
Next Episode

23:00.510 --> 23:00.990
Young Master,

23:00.991 --> 23:02.510
I just saw someone go in.

23:03.510 --> 23:04.510
Xiao Chen.

23:06.350 --> 23:07.670
There are traps here?

23:09.150 --> 23:09.830
This is

23:10.070 --> 23:11.190
Dragon Essence Crystal.

23:12.830 --> 23:13.990
I was just looking for you.

23:14.510 --> 23:16.470
I didn't expect you to
come hereto meet your end.

23:18.230 --> 23:19.910
Eight Volumes of Transformation. Attack!

23:23.750 --> 23:24.790
Attempt to suppress me?

23:28.750 --> 23:30.349
Then prepare to face

23:30.350 --> 23:33.150
the dragon energy of the
Eight-Armed Evil Dragon.

23:33.910 --> 23:36.000
World of Immortals

23:36.001 --> 23:37.010
 Dragon Island Arc
